  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DRRS Brazil, Porto Alegre 2025 Follow-up &#x2013; Team Lead</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rio Grande do Sul and specifically the city Porto Alegre has been facing serious water and flood problems in 2024. The heavy rain and recent floods in 2024 have caused a humanitarian crisis in the city. The team lead is following up and monitoring the outcomes from Dutch Risk Reduction and Surge Support (DRRS) interventions in 2024, and is having conversations with multiple stakeholders i.e. the World Bank and the Inter American Development Bank (IADB) for financing possibilities.</narrative>
  </description>
